  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">"Fabrications was printed predominantly in 18/28 Scripps Goudy on Somerset Satin. Fabric was stretched around a birch plywood block; the sandragraph was then printed.  Experimental techniques were used on the right-hand pages to depict the sound of moving fabric.  The binding is a butterfly accordion style; gently pull the foredge and the pages will pop out for display purposes"--Colophon.</subfield>
  </datafield>
